WEBVTT

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:45.400
(Support Admin Watch on kissFlix.co)

00:01:00.905 --> 00:01:02.585
From now on, no matter what happens,

00:01:02.665 --> 00:01:05.305
I won't let you face it alone.

00:01:05.385 --> 00:01:07.465
You really chose her over me.

00:01:07.545 --> 00:01:08.705
I chose my own life.

00:01:08.785 --> 00:01:11.705
And I won't let anyone
hurt the one I love.

00:01:11.785 --> 00:01:13.825
I feel so lucky

00:01:13.905 --> 00:01:16.065
to have you by my side.

00:01:19.785 --> 00:01:21.585
I understand.

00:01:21.665 --> 00:01:24.665
I just didn't want her
to have a difficult life,

00:01:25.625 --> 00:01:28.905
but in the end,
I'm the one who's at fault.

00:01:37.585 --> 00:01:41.225
You seem to be really happy
without me, huh, Runch?

00:01:45.025 --> 00:01:46.985
I did my best to raise you right.

00:01:47.065 --> 00:01:49.065
I've done everything for you.

00:01:49.145 --> 00:01:50.145
But in the end,

00:01:50.225 --> 00:01:52.985
I wasn't the one you chose to stand by.

00:01:54.145 --> 00:01:56.425
Great. Just great.

00:02:01.465 --> 00:02:05.065
I took this picture
for you to see how she's doing.

00:02:14.585 --> 00:02:16.505
Runch, if your happiness

00:02:16.585 --> 00:02:19.305
comes at the cost of treating me horribly,

00:02:19.385 --> 00:02:21.185
I won't back down.

00:02:21.265 --> 00:02:23.865
There's no way
I'm losing you to that girl.

00:02:28.065 --> 00:02:30.225
Our grand opening is just one day away.

00:02:30.305 --> 00:02:31.865
There'll be lots of guests and press,

00:02:31.945 --> 00:02:34.665
so there's no room for error.

00:02:34.745 --> 00:02:37.945
For tomorrow's tasting,
please tell the kitchen

00:02:38.025 --> 00:02:40.185
to try serving on our actual timeline.

00:02:40.265 --> 00:02:41.945
It won't be just about the flavors.

00:02:42.025 --> 00:02:44.265
As for the PR,
I want the key message to be clear,

00:02:44.345 --> 00:02:47.705
because we don't just sell the food
but also the experience.

00:02:47.785 --> 00:02:50.425
If you have any concerns
or think you can't make it in time,

00:02:50.505 --> 00:02:52.425
please let me know now.

00:02:52.505 --> 00:02:54.345
I don't want to solve problems on the day.

00:02:54.425 --> 00:02:57.105
I assure you everything
will be ready in time, Ms. Peeracha.

00:02:57.745 --> 00:02:59.385
Perfect.

00:02:59.465 --> 00:03:02.385
When can we finalize the VIP guest list?

00:03:02.465 --> 00:03:04.865
We should get it done by this evening.

00:03:04.945 --> 00:03:05.785
Perfect.

00:03:05.865 --> 00:03:07.105
I want every team

00:03:07.185 --> 00:03:08.985
to send me an update by 3:00 p.m. today,

00:03:09.065 --> 00:03:11.105
then we'll have a final meeting
tomorrow morning.

00:03:11.705 --> 00:03:13.465
That's all. Thank you.

00:03:20.545 --> 00:03:22.425
Excuse me. Someone sent you flowers.

00:03:23.225 --> 00:03:24.465
Who was it?

00:03:31.945 --> 00:03:33.785
Thanks for the flowers.

00:03:33.865 --> 00:03:35.145
My pleasure.

00:03:35.745 --> 00:03:37.025
I had them delivered to you.

00:03:39.545 --> 00:03:42.265
Now Nat will never stop teasing me.

00:03:45.265 --> 00:03:47.065
She'll keep teasing you,

00:03:47.145 --> 00:03:48.545
no matter what I do.

00:03:48.625 --> 00:03:51.025
Well, she likes you.

00:03:51.105 --> 00:03:54.545
She even said she's jealous of me
for marrying you.

00:03:54.625 --> 00:03:56.105
Yeah?

00:03:57.905 --> 00:03:59.385
Anyway,

00:03:59.465 --> 00:04:02.265
thanks again for the pretty flowers.

00:04:03.865 --> 00:04:06.465
These pretty flowers

00:04:06.545 --> 00:04:09.225
are perfect for a pretty girl like you.

00:04:11.825 --> 00:04:13.745
You look so pretty today, Neen.

00:04:14.545 --> 00:04:16.985
-You say that every day.
-Well,

00:04:17.064 --> 00:04:18.985
that's just the truth.

00:04:19.064 --> 00:04:20.985
You look pretty every day.

00:04:23.265 --> 00:04:24.825
You're sweet-talking me.

00:04:24.905 --> 00:04:27.065
Do you want something?

00:04:32.385 --> 00:04:34.585
Can I tell you that tonight?

00:04:35.105 --> 00:04:36.825
I guess I'll wait.

00:04:38.065 --> 00:04:39.425
Right now,

00:04:40.625 --> 00:04:42.105
I just want to kiss you.

00:04:43.785 --> 00:04:45.745
I want to kiss you too.

00:04:47.385 --> 00:04:49.385
You can do even more than that.

00:04:57.385 --> 00:04:59.905
No. I have to get back to work.
Come on. Get up.

00:04:59.985 --> 00:05:00.945
I'm too tired.

00:05:01.025 --> 00:05:03.705
Come on. Get up.

00:05:06.785 --> 00:05:08.105
Come in.

00:05:15.025 --> 00:05:18.545
Boss, can I speak to you for a moment?

00:05:19.585 --> 00:05:20.745
What is it?

00:05:23.385 --> 00:05:26.705
I wanted to apologize to you

00:05:26.785 --> 00:05:29.145
for everything I've done.

00:05:32.985 --> 00:05:35.505
I'm sorry for my behavior,
for insulting you,

00:05:35.585 --> 00:05:38.105
and for crossing the line.

00:05:38.945 --> 00:05:40.625
I did some thinking and realized

00:05:41.705 --> 00:05:44.025
all the things I've done
were unfair to you.

00:05:47.825 --> 00:05:48.745
Sure.

00:05:49.425 --> 00:05:51.025
Is there anything else?

00:05:53.505 --> 00:05:54.785
I just wanted

00:05:54.865 --> 00:05:57.545
to let you know
that I'm here if you need help

00:05:57.625 --> 00:05:58.825
with anything.

00:05:59.505 --> 00:06:01.025
I'd be happy to help.

00:06:04.905 --> 00:06:05.865
Sure.

00:06:06.545 --> 00:06:09.385
If there's anything, I'll let you know.

00:06:11.985 --> 00:06:13.585
That's all I wanted to hear.

00:06:14.185 --> 00:06:15.185
Alright.

00:06:19.865 --> 00:06:23.385
Oh, Mrs. Ging. What a coincidence.

00:06:23.905 --> 00:06:27.345
It seems all kinds of people
come to this coffee shop.

00:06:30.025 --> 00:06:33.265
I think it's nice. This way,
you'll see different world views.

00:06:33.345 --> 00:06:35.945
Some views aren't worth seeing, though.

00:06:36.025 --> 00:06:38.745
If you don't want to see it, then don't.

00:06:39.625 --> 00:06:42.745
The world has changed.
Even if you try to ignore it,

00:06:42.825 --> 00:06:45.145
the Earth won't stop spinning.

00:06:48.785 --> 00:06:50.825
You're as eloquent as always.

00:06:52.065 --> 00:06:53.305
Not really.

00:06:53.385 --> 00:06:56.505
I just never say things
I will regret later.

00:06:57.545 --> 00:06:59.345
I hope this coffee

00:07:00.065 --> 00:07:03.305
makes your day a little better.

00:07:17.265 --> 00:07:19.305
You ran into Runch's mother?

00:07:19.385 --> 00:07:21.185
Did she do something to you?

00:07:21.265 --> 00:07:22.865
What could she possibly do to me?

00:07:22.945 --> 00:07:24.785
I'm not that fragile.

00:07:26.545 --> 00:07:27.825
What about you, though?

00:07:27.905 --> 00:07:29.505
Did you do something to her?

00:07:29.585 --> 00:07:32.985
When she saw me,
she just kept glaring at me.

00:07:34.265 --> 00:07:36.625
She'll hate me no matter what I do.

00:07:37.705 --> 00:07:39.625
I don't know why she doesn't love me.

00:07:39.705 --> 00:07:42.265
I'm a very lovable person.

00:07:42.345 --> 00:07:43.705
Oh, really?

00:07:43.785 --> 00:07:44.705
Mom.

00:07:48.785 --> 00:07:50.545
Seeing Mrs. Ging act that way

00:07:51.105 --> 00:07:52.465
makes me feel so bad for Runch.

00:07:53.985 --> 00:07:57.065
Yeah. I don't even want Runch
to have to choose.

00:07:57.145 --> 00:08:00.865
I just don't want to feel like
I'm competing with anyone.

00:08:01.465 --> 00:08:03.985
Hey, you're not competing with anyone.

00:08:04.065 --> 00:08:06.825
If being in a relationship
feels like a competition,

00:08:06.905 --> 00:08:09.825
that means someone isn't letting go.

00:08:14.385 --> 00:08:15.425
Well,

00:08:16.305 --> 00:08:18.985
aren't you mad at me
that things have come to this?

00:08:19.665 --> 00:08:21.625
I'm more mad at the world

00:08:21.705 --> 00:08:24.545
for turning love
into something you have to prove.

00:08:26.425 --> 00:08:27.665
Don't worry, though.

00:08:28.265 --> 00:08:30.065
The fact that we're getting along

00:08:30.145 --> 00:08:33.545
means we're luckier than a lot of people.

00:08:35.784 --> 00:08:36.985
I love you, Mom.

00:08:40.545 --> 00:08:43.545
If you're this sweet, then I can't argue.

00:08:43.625 --> 00:08:44.545
See?

00:08:48.025 --> 00:08:49.145
Good girl.

00:08:55.345 --> 00:08:57.505
I ran into Kaekai today.

00:08:59.305 --> 00:09:00.825
She was so rude.

00:09:00.905 --> 00:09:02.745
That woman has a mouth on her.

00:09:02.825 --> 00:09:04.225
She had nothing to say

00:09:04.825 --> 00:09:06.705
but snarky comments.

00:09:07.785 --> 00:09:10.545
So that's where her daughter got it from.

00:09:10.625 --> 00:09:12.705
She got it from her.

00:09:12.785 --> 00:09:14.385
Those two

00:09:14.465 --> 00:09:16.545
always act so holier-than-thou.

00:09:16.625 --> 00:09:18.185
Well, did you say something

00:09:18.265 --> 00:09:20.545
-to make her--
-Pong.

00:09:21.385 --> 00:09:23.105
Are you saying it was my fault?

00:09:24.065 --> 00:09:26.585
That's not it. I'm just…

00:09:26.665 --> 00:09:29.865
Pong, you're taking her side too?

00:09:29.945 --> 00:09:32.105
Why is no one ever on my side?

00:09:32.185 --> 00:09:34.545
-I'm not--
-Not my husband, not my daughter!

00:09:34.625 --> 00:09:37.305
I'm not taking anyone's side.
I just want you to calm down.

00:09:37.385 --> 00:09:40.985
Calm down?
Do you have any idea how I feel?

00:09:42.225 --> 00:09:43.625
I'm a mother.

00:09:44.385 --> 00:09:46.065
I've done everything for my daughter.

00:09:46.785 --> 00:09:47.945
But in the end,

00:09:48.025 --> 00:09:50.305
nobody wants me.

00:09:50.905 --> 00:09:53.345
No one said that. You're the one

00:09:53.425 --> 00:09:54.745
who pushed everyone away.

00:09:54.825 --> 00:09:58.225
I didn't. I just don't want to give up.

00:09:58.825 --> 00:09:59.745
You don't have to win

00:09:59.825 --> 00:10:02.065
to be the mother she wants.

00:10:03.585 --> 00:10:05.305
You don't get me either.

00:10:26.665 --> 00:10:28.865
What's that smell? Smells so good.

00:10:28.945 --> 00:10:30.145
It's an aroma.

00:10:30.745 --> 00:10:32.265
It's lavender.

00:10:37.865 --> 00:10:40.105
You see, Nat told me

00:10:40.185 --> 00:10:42.545
you're opening a restaurant.

00:10:43.385 --> 00:10:46.905
This smell can help you de-stress,

00:10:47.505 --> 00:10:49.945
making you feel calm, relaxed,

00:10:50.025 --> 00:10:51.905
and at ease.

00:10:55.905 --> 00:10:59.225
Wow. It does make me feel better.

00:11:01.185 --> 00:11:03.145
But you know,

00:11:03.225 --> 00:11:05.145
I don't need to look any further

00:11:05.225 --> 00:11:07.225
for the aroma that helps the most.

00:11:17.225 --> 00:11:18.945
It's your scent, of course.

00:11:21.705 --> 00:11:23.945
It's so refreshing, honey.

00:11:26.265 --> 00:11:28.345
You're in such a good mood.

00:11:28.945 --> 00:11:31.465
Are you ready to hear my request?

00:11:33.865 --> 00:11:35.065
What is it?

00:11:35.905 --> 00:11:37.945
I'm willing to give you anything.

00:11:52.305 --> 00:11:53.985
This is what you wanted?

00:11:55.665 --> 00:11:57.985
I wanted to give you a massage

00:11:59.105 --> 00:12:02.145
because I knew you'd be so tired

00:12:02.665 --> 00:12:05.665
after working at your office all day.

00:12:12.425 --> 00:12:13.465
Right there.

00:12:14.465 --> 00:12:15.705
It's really sore.

00:12:17.345 --> 00:12:19.905
You know me too well, Runch.

00:12:37.185 --> 00:12:38.745
Anywhere else?

00:12:42.385 --> 00:12:43.545
My cheeks.

00:12:55.065 --> 00:12:57.785
I think using your lips

00:12:57.865 --> 00:12:59.625
would work even better.

00:13:27.505 --> 00:13:28.745
Anywhere else?

00:13:33.385 --> 00:13:34.465
My lips.

00:13:59.385 --> 00:14:00.905
Are all the tables ready?

00:14:00.985 --> 00:14:03.825
Everything will be ready in ten minutes.

00:14:03.905 --> 00:14:07.505
Then tell the kitchen to reheat the sauce,

00:14:07.585 --> 00:14:08.985
but don't let it boil.

00:14:09.065 --> 00:14:09.905
Okay.

00:14:09.985 --> 00:14:12.465
When does the first set of guests arrive?

00:14:12.545 --> 00:14:13.905
In 45 minutes.

00:14:13.985 --> 00:14:16.025
Okay. We still have time.

00:14:20.465 --> 00:14:24.585
Everyone, please pace yourselves.

00:14:24.665 --> 00:14:26.945
No need to rush or panic.
Just stay focused

00:14:27.025 --> 00:14:28.985
and do your best.

00:14:30.305 --> 00:14:31.385
Yes, ma'am.

00:14:31.465 --> 00:14:34.145
I'll go handle everything you asked for.

00:14:34.225 --> 00:14:35.225
Go for it.

00:14:41.465 --> 00:14:42.945
Oh, Runch!

00:14:45.305 --> 00:14:46.905
When did you get here?

00:14:46.985 --> 00:14:48.665
A while ago.

00:14:48.745 --> 00:14:51.905
Well, why didn't you say anything, then?

00:14:51.985 --> 00:14:54.745
Well, you were busy working.

00:14:54.825 --> 00:14:58.185
I was going to ask if you needed a hand.

00:14:59.465 --> 00:15:01.345
But apparently,

00:15:01.425 --> 00:15:03.025
you don't need it.

00:15:03.705 --> 00:15:06.705
Oh, actually, there's one thing.

00:15:07.305 --> 00:15:08.385
What is it?

00:15:11.305 --> 00:15:13.465
Can you stay and be my moral support?

00:15:14.385 --> 00:15:16.545
Stay here and don't go anywhere.

00:15:17.465 --> 00:15:18.665
Of course.

00:15:19.265 --> 00:15:21.745
I wasn't planning to anyway.

00:15:30.785 --> 00:15:33.065
YOU HAVE A NEW MESSAGE

00:15:33.145 --> 00:15:36.305
Ma'am, Ms. Runch is taking
the afternoon off today

00:15:36.385 --> 00:15:38.945
She's attending the grand opening
of Ms. Peeracha's restaurant.

00:15:40.105 --> 00:15:42.705
Do you know where that is, Mr. Utt?

00:17:20.224 --> 00:17:23.184
Neen sure did a great job organizing this.

00:17:23.704 --> 00:17:26.625
The vibe here is laid-back,

00:17:26.704 --> 00:17:29.225
warm, relaxed,

00:17:29.305 --> 00:17:30.865
and not too formal.

00:17:30.945 --> 00:17:32.265
It's like a family party.

00:17:33.785 --> 00:17:35.745
I think so too.

00:17:35.825 --> 00:17:38.505
But seeing Runch and Neen together

00:17:38.585 --> 00:17:40.225
makes it look more like a wedding

00:17:40.305 --> 00:17:41.985
than a restaurant grand opening.

00:17:47.985 --> 00:17:49.105
I know, right?

00:17:52.145 --> 00:17:54.945
Excuse me.
A reporter wants to interview you

00:17:55.025 --> 00:17:56.585
as a family.

00:17:56.665 --> 00:17:57.665
Sure.

00:17:58.985 --> 00:18:00.665
Neen. Runch.

00:18:01.625 --> 00:18:03.385
-Come here.
-Come on.

00:18:34.305 --> 00:18:35.545
I'm so sorry,

00:18:35.625 --> 00:18:38.625
but this event requires
an online invitation.

00:18:38.705 --> 00:18:40.505
I can enter without one.

00:18:40.585 --> 00:18:42.305
Sorry, ma'am,

00:18:42.385 --> 00:18:44.385
I really can't let you in
without an invitation.

00:18:44.465 --> 00:18:46.305
I'm Peeracha's mother-in-law. Got it?

00:18:46.385 --> 00:18:50.785
Ma'am, please don't lie.
You? Peeracha's mother-in-law?

00:18:50.865 --> 00:18:52.545
You're just trying to get in for free.

00:18:52.625 --> 00:18:54.785
Idiot! I'm telling the truth.

00:18:54.865 --> 00:18:56.065
I'm not lying, so move!

00:18:56.145 --> 00:18:57.905
Excuse me! Ma'am?

00:18:57.985 --> 00:18:59.545
-So you're refusing to leave?
-Move!

00:18:59.625 --> 00:19:01.425
-Get out of my way! I said I'd--
-Please, ma'am.

00:19:01.505 --> 00:19:02.825
-Ma'am, please leave.
-Guard!

00:19:02.905 --> 00:19:04.785
-What?
-Sorry. We really can't let you in.

00:19:04.865 --> 00:19:06.305
-Move!
-No!

00:19:06.385 --> 00:19:07.865
-Please, ma'am.
-Ma'am, no!

00:19:07.945 --> 00:19:09.065
Please leave.

00:19:14.745 --> 00:19:17.105
Runch, come on.

00:19:19.985 --> 00:19:21.705
You go ahead without me.

00:19:21.785 --> 00:19:23.105
I can wait here.

00:19:23.705 --> 00:19:24.825
No way.

00:19:24.905 --> 00:19:27.145
You're my family, you know.

00:19:29.785 --> 00:19:31.825
Neen, bring her over here.

00:19:33.145 --> 00:19:34.945
Runch, come on.

00:19:35.025 --> 00:19:35.865
Come on.

00:19:50.705 --> 00:19:52.505
Today's event feels so warm

00:19:52.585 --> 00:19:54.905
as if it was a family party.

00:19:54.985 --> 00:19:57.665
It doesn't feel like
a restaurant's grand opening at all.

00:19:59.145 --> 00:20:00.065
Actually, yes.

00:20:00.145 --> 00:20:02.625
In a way, this is a family party.

00:20:04.225 --> 00:20:06.865
I hope you don't mind
my daughter-in-law being here too.

00:20:07.665 --> 00:20:10.985
She's like a daughter to us,

00:20:11.065 --> 00:20:13.105
as if we were related by blood.

00:20:14.625 --> 00:20:16.385
So it is a grand opening, after all.

00:20:17.945 --> 00:20:20.265
Then, can I take some photos
of your family--

00:20:20.345 --> 00:20:22.825
Oops! I mean,
your restaurant's grand opening?

00:20:22.905 --> 00:20:24.665
Please look at the camera. This way.

00:20:24.745 --> 00:20:26.305
This camera, please.

00:20:26.385 --> 00:20:28.345
-This way.
-One, two, three.

00:20:29.225 --> 00:20:31.345
A little closer, everyone.

00:20:31.425 --> 00:20:32.865
One, two, three.

00:20:47.385 --> 00:20:49.905
Where were you? Why are you back so late?

00:20:49.985 --> 00:20:51.665
You weren't answering my calls either.

00:20:51.745 --> 00:20:54.225
I was at the grand opening
of Peeracha's restaurant.

00:20:55.185 --> 00:20:56.625
Did you cause any trouble there?

00:20:58.505 --> 00:21:00.425
Why do you think so,

00:21:01.025 --> 00:21:03.185
when I'm the one who's the victim here?

00:21:03.785 --> 00:21:05.585
Guess what? Today,

00:21:06.185 --> 00:21:08.785
our daughter became
part of another family.

00:21:08.865 --> 00:21:10.905
She's not ours anymore.

00:21:11.585 --> 00:21:13.545
She was standing next to another family.

00:21:16.905 --> 00:21:19.945
Both Peeracha and her family

00:21:20.025 --> 00:21:21.745
took Runch away from me.

00:21:26.505 --> 00:21:28.225
They did it right in front of me,

00:21:28.305 --> 00:21:31.185
and no one even noticed me.

00:21:32.225 --> 00:21:35.185
Please just leave her alone
and learn to let it go.

00:21:35.265 --> 00:21:37.825
Like hell I will! She's my daughter!

00:21:37.905 --> 00:21:39.985
How could I just let it slide?

00:21:40.065 --> 00:21:43.025
I didn't raise her
just so she'd choose some girl

00:21:43.105 --> 00:21:44.785
over her own mother.

00:21:44.865 --> 00:21:46.345
Who would be okay with that?!

00:21:47.825 --> 00:21:50.945
Runch is avoiding you,
yet you still don't get it!

00:21:51.025 --> 00:21:52.705
What else is there to get

00:21:52.785 --> 00:21:54.585
other than the fact that she's stupid?

00:21:55.345 --> 00:21:57.505
She doesn't know
her wife is manipulating her.

00:21:57.585 --> 00:21:58.585
She's so well educated,

00:21:58.665 --> 00:22:00.665
and we've spent so much money on her,

00:22:01.225 --> 00:22:02.945
yet she acts like a brainless person.

00:22:03.025 --> 00:22:05.985
Actually, trying to ruin
someone else's family

00:22:06.065 --> 00:22:08.105
is what a brainless person would do.

00:22:08.185 --> 00:22:11.265
-Pong!
-Stop acting like this!

00:22:11.345 --> 00:22:12.905
One day, you'll be left all alone.

00:22:16.225 --> 00:22:17.185
No.

00:22:17.745 --> 00:22:19.545
Runch is just being led astray.

00:22:19.625 --> 00:22:22.465
Soon, she'll realize
who really loves her the most.

00:22:24.025 --> 00:22:26.185
There's no way I'm letting that brat win.

00:22:26.945 --> 00:22:30.385
No matter what,
I need to get my daughter back.

00:22:32.425 --> 00:22:34.185
Do whatever you want.

00:22:34.265 --> 00:22:36.545
Fake being sick
or being dead, for all I care.

00:22:38.265 --> 00:22:40.225
But let me warn you.

00:22:40.305 --> 00:22:41.865
If you keep doing it,

00:22:41.945 --> 00:22:44.305
one day, when you're really sick or dead,

00:22:44.385 --> 00:22:45.985
no one will care for you.

00:22:46.745 --> 00:22:48.545
And I don't mean just our daughter.

00:22:49.185 --> 00:22:52.345
Even I, who you keep fooling,
won't care either.

00:22:53.745 --> 00:22:55.425
And you'd better not forget

00:22:56.665 --> 00:23:00.145
Neen's last name
or what family she's from.

00:23:00.825 --> 00:23:02.985
You'd better watch your step.

00:23:03.065 --> 00:23:04.865
And watch your mouth too.

00:23:04.945 --> 00:23:06.505
You only got away with everything

00:23:06.585 --> 00:23:08.665
because Runch has been protecting you.

00:23:11.265 --> 00:23:13.065
But she's done with you now,

00:23:13.145 --> 00:23:16.105
so that family doesn't have
to hold back anymore.

00:23:17.825 --> 00:23:21.265
If she's really
going to let her wife bully me,

00:23:21.345 --> 00:23:22.785
then so be it.

00:23:22.865 --> 00:23:24.465
How dare you say that

00:23:25.025 --> 00:23:27.345
when you're the one
who's been bullying her?

00:23:28.945 --> 00:23:30.985
You and Runch are equally stupid!

00:23:31.065 --> 00:23:32.865
Why do you care about that brat so much?

00:23:36.825 --> 00:23:38.385
Go ahead. You can all walk away!

00:23:38.465 --> 00:23:40.225
You don't have to care for me!

00:23:40.305 --> 00:23:41.745
I won't beg you to forgive me.

00:24:01.545 --> 00:24:03.585
Isn't my granddaughter just adorable?

00:24:03.665 --> 00:24:07.185
She is. She looks exactly like you.

00:24:07.265 --> 00:24:09.305
That's what they all say.

00:24:10.225 --> 00:24:13.345
You know, at our age,

00:24:13.425 --> 00:24:16.505
just hearing her call you "Grandma"

00:24:16.585 --> 00:24:19.465
really warms your heart.

00:24:19.545 --> 00:24:20.665
I guess you're right.

00:24:21.865 --> 00:24:23.585
What about Runch?

00:24:23.665 --> 00:24:25.185
When is she going to get married?

00:24:25.265 --> 00:24:26.545
She's not young anymore.

00:24:28.705 --> 00:24:30.465
She's not even dating anyone,

00:24:30.545 --> 00:24:32.265
let alone getting married.

00:24:34.825 --> 00:24:36.465
I'm so worried about her.

00:24:39.785 --> 00:24:40.665
Mom.

00:24:41.825 --> 00:24:43.305
What is it, honey?

00:24:44.865 --> 00:24:46.745
I've got something to tell you.

00:24:48.105 --> 00:24:49.265
What is it?

00:24:57.865 --> 00:25:00.065
There's someone I'd like you to meet.

00:25:00.745 --> 00:25:01.945
Is it your date?

00:25:03.905 --> 00:25:05.425
Really?

00:25:06.345 --> 00:25:08.425
We haven't known each other for long,

00:25:08.505 --> 00:25:10.865
but I'm so in love with them, Mom.

00:25:13.425 --> 00:25:16.065
They're so cute and bubbly.

00:25:16.145 --> 00:25:19.665
I feel at home whenever I'm with them.

00:25:19.745 --> 00:25:21.785
Look, Runch. No matter who you love,

00:25:21.865 --> 00:25:24.425
I'll love them too.

00:25:24.505 --> 00:25:27.225
Bring your date over sometime.
I want to meet him.

00:25:28.065 --> 00:25:29.505
Sure, Mom.

00:25:30.105 --> 00:25:32.145
Hello, Dad. Hello, Mom.

00:25:32.225 --> 00:25:33.745
-Hello.
-Hello.

00:25:40.585 --> 00:25:42.265
What are you looking for?

00:25:42.345 --> 00:25:44.185
Your date, of course.

00:25:44.265 --> 00:25:45.825
Why isn't he here yet?

00:25:47.505 --> 00:25:48.985
Here she is.

00:25:49.585 --> 00:25:50.665
Her name is Neen.

00:26:03.385 --> 00:26:04.385
Honey?

00:26:06.145 --> 00:26:07.905
This is so unexpected.

00:26:08.425 --> 00:26:12.305
I can't believe
our daughter is into girls.

00:26:12.905 --> 00:26:15.505
That's a normal thing these days.

00:26:15.585 --> 00:26:18.105
As long as she's a good person
who truly loves our daughter,

00:26:18.185 --> 00:26:19.425
isn't that all that matters?

00:26:19.505 --> 00:26:20.505
No.

00:26:21.305 --> 00:26:22.825
I won't allow it.

00:26:24.265 --> 00:26:27.705
I don't believe
this kind of love can last.

00:26:27.785 --> 00:26:29.745
It's just a phase.

00:26:29.825 --> 00:26:31.705
Runch is probably just curious.

00:26:31.785 --> 00:26:33.865
Once she gets bored, they'll break up.

00:26:36.705 --> 00:26:39.425
You're belittling her feelings.

00:26:39.505 --> 00:26:40.785
I'm not.

00:26:40.865 --> 00:26:43.665
It's just that I know her well.

00:26:43.745 --> 00:26:45.905
She's never acted this way before.

00:26:45.985 --> 00:26:48.105
This is not her true self.

00:26:48.185 --> 00:26:51.625
Maybe you just can't
accept her for being herself.

00:26:54.385 --> 00:26:56.505
Either way, I really don't believe

00:26:56.585 --> 00:26:58.825
that they'll last.

00:26:58.905 --> 00:27:02.225
We're planning to get married.

00:27:03.625 --> 00:27:06.465
I'm really happy for you both.

00:27:06.545 --> 00:27:09.465
Keep your love strong
and always take care of each other, okay?

00:27:10.305 --> 00:27:12.865
-Thank you.
-Thank you, Dad.

00:27:12.945 --> 00:27:14.225
Have you thought this through?

00:27:15.265 --> 00:27:16.105
Yes.

00:27:16.665 --> 00:27:18.465
We both have.

00:27:18.985 --> 00:27:19.985
That's right.

00:27:20.065 --> 00:27:22.665
In fact, we've already
registered our marriage.

00:27:23.265 --> 00:27:24.265
What?

00:27:32.985 --> 00:27:33.945
Okay.

00:27:35.145 --> 00:27:36.905
When's the wedding going to be?

00:27:38.025 --> 00:27:40.385
We'll plan the wedding
as soon as our house is done.

00:27:40.465 --> 00:27:42.785
House? What house?

00:27:43.745 --> 00:27:45.025
My parents

00:27:45.105 --> 00:27:47.665
bought us a house to move into
after getting married.

00:27:47.745 --> 00:27:50.345
Does that mean you'll move out

00:27:50.425 --> 00:27:53.505
once you get married, Runch?

00:27:54.545 --> 00:27:55.705
Yes, Mom.

00:27:58.905 --> 00:28:00.105
You'll be fine.

00:28:05.425 --> 00:28:07.225
I know it's not easy,

00:28:07.305 --> 00:28:10.385
but our daughter's all grown up now.
We have to let her live.

00:28:10.985 --> 00:28:13.305
I can accept that she's into girls.

00:28:13.385 --> 00:28:15.265
That's a normal thing these days.

00:28:16.065 --> 00:28:18.385
I'm not that conservative.

00:28:18.985 --> 00:28:21.265
I just don't want it to be that girl.

00:28:23.985 --> 00:28:26.225
That girl's coming into my daughter's life

00:28:26.905 --> 00:28:29.065
and taking her away from me.

00:28:29.145 --> 00:28:32.145
She didn't take Runch.
Runch was the one who chose her.

00:28:32.985 --> 00:28:34.505
Without Peeracha,

00:28:34.585 --> 00:28:36.825
my daughter wouldn't have
considered marriage,

00:28:36.905 --> 00:28:40.145
moving out, or walking out of my life.

00:28:41.225 --> 00:28:43.465
I can accept anything,

00:28:43.545 --> 00:28:46.105
except for the fact

00:28:47.585 --> 00:28:49.025
that that woman

00:28:49.945 --> 00:28:54.305
is taking my place in Runch's life.

00:28:54.385 --> 00:28:56.985
Neen isn't taking anyone's place, Ging.

00:28:57.505 --> 00:28:59.305
But my daughter chose her,

00:29:00.305 --> 00:29:01.665
not me.

00:29:08.665 --> 00:29:10.505
From this moment on,

00:29:11.265 --> 00:29:12.345
there's no way

00:29:13.065 --> 00:29:15.465
I'll ever see that woman in a good light.

00:30:03.105 --> 00:30:04.705
So many positive comments!

00:30:05.265 --> 00:30:08.465
"Every dish was great."
"Warm service, felt like home."

00:30:08.545 --> 00:30:10.505
"The vibe there was so laid-back." Whoa!

00:30:11.985 --> 00:30:14.945
Well, they like it
because you put your heart into it.

00:30:15.025 --> 00:30:17.465
Look, look! Read this one.

00:30:17.545 --> 00:30:19.905
"Ms. Peeracha's family
seems so sweet and warm."

00:30:19.985 --> 00:30:21.505
"They seem so warm."

00:30:21.585 --> 00:30:23.865
"Her parents seem very kind."

00:30:25.465 --> 00:30:26.705
And this too.

00:30:34.345 --> 00:30:36.385
"Ms. Peeracha's wife is stunning.

00:30:36.465 --> 00:30:39.425
She looks elegant,
luxurious, yet so kind."

00:30:41.345 --> 00:30:42.345
Wait a second.

00:30:43.305 --> 00:30:44.545
They're only complimenting you.

00:30:44.625 --> 00:30:46.865
What about me, the restaurant owner?

00:30:48.745 --> 00:30:51.185
It's because you're obviously pretty.

00:30:51.265 --> 00:30:52.585
There's no need for compliments.

00:30:52.665 --> 00:30:55.185
Of course there is. That's not fair.

00:30:55.265 --> 00:30:57.065
Now I'm starting to worry.

00:30:57.865 --> 00:31:00.025
About what?

00:31:00.545 --> 00:31:03.585
Well, the whole world
is falling in love with my wife.

00:31:03.665 --> 00:31:05.225
I've got to do something about that.

00:31:05.305 --> 00:31:07.345
What are you going to do?

00:31:07.865 --> 00:31:11.065
I'm going to show the whole world

00:31:11.145 --> 00:31:14.425
that you're mine,
and that I love you very much.

00:31:17.745 --> 00:31:20.385
What if they already know?

00:31:21.545 --> 00:31:24.385
I'll still do it
just so everything's clear.

00:31:28.825 --> 00:31:31.185
-Stop. Stop it, Neen.
-No.

00:31:33.905 --> 00:31:35.745
You sure you won't stop?

00:31:36.345 --> 00:31:38.185
Yes, I am, gorgeous.

00:31:42.025 --> 00:31:43.065
What are you doing?

00:31:44.865 --> 00:31:45.945
What are you doing?

00:31:47.585 --> 00:31:50.185
You've really got me going now.

00:32:47.825 --> 00:32:48.825
Hello?

00:32:49.465 --> 00:32:50.865
Hello, ma'am.

00:32:51.945 --> 00:32:54.985
I just read about the grand opening
of Ms. Peeracha's restaurant.

00:32:56.065 --> 00:32:57.625
I found it very strange.

00:32:58.265 --> 00:33:00.145
You weren't in any of the photos.

00:33:04.345 --> 00:33:07.545
There was only Ms. Runch
and Ms. Peeracha's family.

00:33:09.505 --> 00:33:12.385
That's so disrespectful to you.

00:33:12.465 --> 00:33:14.665
No matter what,
you're still Ms. Runch's mother.

00:33:15.785 --> 00:33:17.905
It's almost like

00:33:17.985 --> 00:33:20.545
she's trying to cut you out.

00:33:22.545 --> 00:33:24.505
Yesterday, I went to the restaurant.

00:33:24.585 --> 00:33:26.305
They wouldn't let me in.

00:33:26.385 --> 00:33:27.865
They told me to leave.

00:33:29.225 --> 00:33:30.505
Whoa.

00:33:31.105 --> 00:33:33.185
They'd really go that far?

00:33:34.065 --> 00:33:35.825
If I were you, I wouldn't let it slide.

00:33:36.705 --> 00:33:38.665
They humiliated you,

00:33:39.465 --> 00:33:41.745
so you've got to do the same.

00:33:43.185 --> 00:33:44.665
That type of person

00:33:44.745 --> 00:33:46.345
needs to be taught a lesson

00:33:46.425 --> 00:33:48.025
before they start to feel something.

00:33:51.865 --> 00:33:53.945
I don't want you to be hurt.

00:33:54.705 --> 00:33:57.185
I just hate seeing a good person like you

00:33:57.265 --> 00:33:59.105
getting kicked when you're down.

00:34:00.025 --> 00:34:02.225
If you do nothing,

00:34:02.305 --> 00:34:04.865
people may think you've given up.

00:34:09.824 --> 00:34:11.705
No matter what you decide to do,

00:34:12.304 --> 00:34:13.784
I will support you.

00:34:27.344 --> 00:34:29.744
Hi. I'd like to book a table
at your restaurant.

00:34:31.505 --> 00:34:35.344
For two, please.
Around five in the evening.

00:34:36.625 --> 00:34:37.784
Yes.

00:34:37.865 --> 00:34:40.145
Under the name Runch, please.

00:34:40.905 --> 00:34:42.185
Thank you.

00:35:09.425 --> 00:35:12.105
Now's your chance to get revenge.

00:35:12.185 --> 00:35:15.705
Ms. Runch is meeting with
Ms. Peeracha this evening at five.

00:35:16.305 --> 00:35:19.945
As for the location, I'll tell you later.

00:35:35.825 --> 00:35:39.665
Boss, I didn't drive here today.

00:35:39.745 --> 00:35:41.945
Would you mind giving me a ride?

00:35:43.585 --> 00:35:45.745
I have to go to Sukhumvit today.

00:35:45.825 --> 00:35:46.825
I won't be driving home.

00:35:47.425 --> 00:35:49.265
Oh, perfect, then.

00:35:49.345 --> 00:35:50.825
That's where I need to be.

00:35:50.905 --> 00:35:52.945
Would you mind giving me a ride?

00:35:57.145 --> 00:35:57.985
Fine.

00:36:08.785 --> 00:36:11.465
What a strange day, huh?

00:36:14.905 --> 00:36:16.465
It feels like…

00:36:18.505 --> 00:36:20.065
there's no need to rush

00:36:20.865 --> 00:36:22.305
or beware of anything.

00:36:23.665 --> 00:36:24.945
I feel it too.

00:36:26.505 --> 00:36:27.745
It's like

00:36:28.905 --> 00:36:31.985
we get to pace ourselves again.

00:36:38.225 --> 00:36:40.465
If I told you

00:36:40.545 --> 00:36:43.145
this was the best meal I've had in months,

00:36:43.225 --> 00:36:44.425
would you believe me?

00:36:46.465 --> 00:36:49.825
If you told me it's because of the food…

00:36:51.905 --> 00:36:53.105
I wouldn't believe you.

00:36:56.305 --> 00:36:58.585
But if you told me
it's because of the vibe,

00:36:58.665 --> 00:36:59.625
then I would.

00:37:01.145 --> 00:37:02.545
Cheers, then.

00:37:05.145 --> 00:37:08.025
To our family. To us.

00:37:08.985 --> 00:37:10.145
Cheers.

00:37:20.705 --> 00:37:22.385
You know, I'm glad

00:37:23.945 --> 00:37:26.225
to see you genuinely happy.

00:37:30.665 --> 00:37:32.825
It's not the food that makes me happy.

00:37:33.865 --> 00:37:36.425
It's having you by my side.

00:37:38.145 --> 00:37:39.585
I used to think

00:37:40.225 --> 00:37:42.705
happiness always came at a price.

00:37:46.065 --> 00:37:48.265
But now, I'm starting to believe

00:37:49.945 --> 00:37:51.865
that as long as we choose each other,

00:37:52.705 --> 00:37:54.025
that's all that matters.

00:37:55.185 --> 00:37:56.705
Where are you, ma'am?

00:37:57.745 --> 00:37:59.865
Oh, you're almost here?

00:38:06.105 --> 00:38:10.825
Excuse me, do you own a car
with the license plate YL7227?

00:38:10.905 --> 00:38:13.065
-Yes.
-Could you check your car?

00:38:13.145 --> 00:38:15.505
Someone said it was just hit.

00:38:15.585 --> 00:38:17.425
-Really?
-Yes, ma'am.

00:38:21.825 --> 00:38:22.665
I'll come with you.

00:38:22.745 --> 00:38:25.025
That's fine. I can go on my own.

00:38:25.105 --> 00:38:27.065
-Are you sure? Okay.
-Yeah.

00:38:47.825 --> 00:38:49.505
I don't see any scratches.

00:38:54.385 --> 00:38:56.145
Mom? How'd you get here?

00:38:59.505 --> 00:39:00.545
Are you crazy?!

00:39:00.625 --> 00:39:01.945
You're the crazy one here!

00:39:02.545 --> 00:39:04.945
It's because of you that Runch hates me

00:39:05.025 --> 00:39:06.305
and wants to ignore me!

00:39:06.385 --> 00:39:07.745
It's because of you!

00:39:07.825 --> 00:39:09.745
She hates you? How is that my fault?

00:39:11.265 --> 00:39:12.185
Crazy bitch!

00:39:14.105 --> 00:39:14.985
Did you just push me?

00:39:15.705 --> 00:39:17.345
-You bitch, how dare you!
-Stop it!

00:39:17.425 --> 00:39:19.185
You had no right to do this to me!

00:39:19.265 --> 00:39:20.265
Like hell I'll stop!

00:39:22.745 --> 00:39:25.745
This is nothing
compared to you taking my daughter!

00:39:29.665 --> 00:39:31.225
You think you've won?

00:39:31.305 --> 00:39:33.905
You think you finally
took Runch from me, huh?

00:39:34.785 --> 00:39:36.945
What are you talking about? She chose me!

00:39:37.025 --> 00:39:38.265
You're the one who can't let go!

00:39:38.345 --> 00:39:40.585
Shut up already. Without you,

00:39:40.665 --> 00:39:42.985
my daughter never
would've turned against me!

00:39:47.505 --> 00:39:49.665
You shameless bitch.
You always act all nice

00:39:49.745 --> 00:39:52.785
and sweet, but you're just a selfish girl

00:39:52.865 --> 00:39:54.625
who wants to steal everything from others!

00:39:55.985 --> 00:39:58.545
If that's how you feel,
then that's your problem,

00:39:58.625 --> 00:40:00.385
not mine. You crazy bitch!

00:40:03.545 --> 00:40:05.825
How dare you lecture me?

00:40:05.905 --> 00:40:08.105
I've done everything to raise my daughter!

00:40:12.105 --> 00:40:13.065
Crazy bitch!

00:40:15.225 --> 00:40:16.065
Stop it, Mom!

00:40:17.065 --> 00:40:19.225
Mom!

00:40:19.305 --> 00:40:20.905
That's enough, Mom! Stop!

00:40:21.905 --> 00:40:23.105
What the hell are you doing?!

00:40:30.425 --> 00:40:31.345
Neen.

00:40:42.225 --> 00:40:44.065
Runch, Runch!

00:40:44.745 --> 00:40:46.905
Didn't you see what she did to me?

00:40:46.985 --> 00:40:48.225
What about you?

00:40:48.305 --> 00:40:49.425
What the hell was that?

00:40:49.505 --> 00:40:50.825
I did this for you!

00:40:50.905 --> 00:40:53.265
-No, you didn't! You never do!
-She attacked me, I swear!

00:40:53.345 --> 00:40:55.145
You never did any of this for me.

00:40:56.185 --> 00:40:57.345
You did it for yourself.

00:40:57.425 --> 00:40:59.825
For your own satisfaction

00:41:00.465 --> 00:41:02.585
and your own self-importance.

00:41:04.905 --> 00:41:05.945
This woman…

00:41:07.505 --> 00:41:09.305
is the one I love.

00:41:09.945 --> 00:41:13.705
She's my wife. So why do you treat her

00:41:13.785 --> 00:41:15.785
like our enemy?

00:41:16.385 --> 00:41:18.425
She took my daughter from me.

00:41:21.705 --> 00:41:23.745
No one took me from you.

00:41:30.985 --> 00:41:32.705
I left you.

00:41:37.825 --> 00:41:38.785
Runch,

00:41:39.505 --> 00:41:40.905
I didn't mean to.

00:41:48.785 --> 00:41:50.865
Stop saying those things.

00:41:54.025 --> 00:41:55.825
I'm a grown-up now.

00:41:55.905 --> 00:41:57.785
I have my own life,

00:41:58.425 --> 00:42:00.465
but you never accepted that.

00:42:05.305 --> 00:42:07.425
I did my best to raise you right.

00:42:07.505 --> 00:42:09.665
I've sacrificed everything for you!

00:42:09.745 --> 00:42:11.585
Yeah, that's right!

00:42:11.665 --> 00:42:13.465
That's exactly right!

00:42:13.545 --> 00:42:15.705
You've sacrificed everything for me.

00:42:16.305 --> 00:42:18.585
And you've been using that fact

00:42:18.665 --> 00:42:21.265
to control me all my life.

00:42:37.785 --> 00:42:39.425
I'm supposed to listen to you,

00:42:40.385 --> 00:42:41.985
stay close to you,

00:42:43.745 --> 00:42:45.465
and never love anyone more than you.

00:42:49.025 --> 00:42:50.265
If I don't,

00:42:50.345 --> 00:42:52.905
then suddenly I'm an ungrateful child.

00:42:52.985 --> 00:42:54.945
No…

00:42:58.985 --> 00:43:00.225
You know,

00:43:01.745 --> 00:43:03.705
what you did today

00:43:04.505 --> 00:43:06.385
just messed up my life.

00:43:16.705 --> 00:43:18.065
Take your mom home.

00:43:20.825 --> 00:43:21.945
Neen.

00:43:23.825 --> 00:43:26.625
Take her, or I'll slap that old hag back.

00:43:27.465 --> 00:43:30.865
Neen, don't solve problems with violence.

00:43:31.665 --> 00:43:33.465
You're upset right now.

00:43:33.545 --> 00:43:35.665
But once you've calmed down,

00:43:35.745 --> 00:43:37.425
you'll regret what you did.

00:43:37.505 --> 00:43:39.145
I won't regret it!

00:43:40.505 --> 00:43:42.105
That old hag needs to learn

00:43:42.185 --> 00:43:43.705
that she can't just slap anyone.

00:43:43.785 --> 00:43:45.345
Come on, then, you little brat!

00:43:45.425 --> 00:43:46.745
-That's enough, Mom!
-Come on.

00:43:46.825 --> 00:43:47.785
Come on.

00:43:47.865 --> 00:43:49.145
Don't!

00:43:49.225 --> 00:43:50.345
Try me!

00:43:50.985 --> 00:43:53.345
Mom, enough.

00:43:56.185 --> 00:43:57.945
I'm taking her home.

00:43:58.025 --> 00:43:59.225
I'll meet you later.

00:43:59.945 --> 00:44:01.905
Let's go.

00:44:41.945 --> 00:44:44.945
LAST YEAR

00:44:45.025 --> 00:44:46.505
I'm so happy

00:44:46.585 --> 00:44:49.385
our marriage is finally registered.

00:44:49.465 --> 00:44:51.385
So am I.

00:44:53.865 --> 00:44:55.065
Runch.

00:44:55.145 --> 00:44:56.305
MARRIAGE CERTIFICATE

00:44:56.385 --> 00:44:59.825
You think your mom
will be okay with us getting married?

00:45:00.585 --> 00:45:02.425
Of course.

00:45:02.505 --> 00:45:08.345
And I'm sure my mom
will love you just like I do.

00:45:09.865 --> 00:45:10.705
Okay.

00:45:12.345 --> 00:45:14.265
I have a question to ask.

00:45:14.345 --> 00:45:15.465
Go for it.

00:45:17.065 --> 00:45:19.625
You said you wanted
to get married when you're 35,

00:45:19.705 --> 00:45:21.705
but you're not 35 yet.

00:45:23.505 --> 00:45:25.145
The earlier I get married,

00:45:25.225 --> 00:45:28.385
the longer I'll have you as my wife.

00:45:29.545 --> 00:45:32.585
We'll be together as wives,

00:45:33.185 --> 00:45:35.985
and we'll grow old together.

00:45:37.745 --> 00:45:40.985
Okay. Let's grow old together.

00:45:53.185 --> 00:45:56.305
If I don't fight,
I'll be left with nothing.

00:45:56.385 --> 00:45:59.705
From now on, I won't take responsibility
for your actions anymore.

00:45:59.785 --> 00:46:00.745
Why wouldn't you sue?

00:46:00.825 --> 00:46:03.105
I don't want to make her choose between

00:46:03.185 --> 00:46:05.025
justice and being a good daughter.

00:46:05.105 --> 00:46:07.465
-You're fired, Utt.
-You'll regret this.

00:46:07.545 --> 00:46:10.865
I don't want my love
to keep hurting you anymore.

00:46:11.465 --> 00:46:13.825
I'll give your mother what she wants.

00:46:14.425 --> 00:46:16.545
You can go back to being her daughter now.

00:46:17.145 --> 00:46:19.705
Let me do this one last thing for you.

00:47:02.705 --> 00:47:04.705
Subtitle translation by:
Ramil Natnitiwitaya